{"availability":"available","full":"anas-aqeel/microsoft-loop-clone","name":"microsoft-loop-clone","description":"A Next.js-based clone of Microsoft Loop with real-time collaborative editing, workspace management, and a notification system, powered by Firebase and Clerk authentication.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":5,"forks":4,"created":"2024-07-30T07:29:06Z","updated":"2024-08-20T10:42:33Z","branch":"Master","homepage":"https://loop-microsoft.vercel.app","topics":["clerk","clerkauth","emoji","firebase","firebase-firestore","googleai","liveblocks","nextjs","novel","novelai","shadcn-ui","tailwind","vercel","vercel-ai-sdk"],"demo":"https://loop-microsoft.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:22.105Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:22.105Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:22.105Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:22.105Z","stars":5,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is a clone of the Microsoft Loop application, built using Next.js for both frontend and backend, with Tailwind CSS for styling, and Firebase for the backend database. The project replicates key features of Microsoft Loop, including collaborative workspaces, real-time document editing, and a notification system for seamless teamwork."],"features":["Authentication: User authentication is managed by Clerk Auth, enabling secure login and registration.","Dashboard: Displays all workspaces associated with the authenticated user. Each workspace can have up to 10 documents, and each workspace can be customized with a name, cover image, and emoji.","Real-time Collaboration: The rich text editor supports real-time, collaborative editing using the Novel Lightweight editor, allowing multiple users to work on the same document simultaneously.","Comments and Mentions: Users can comment on documents and tag other members of the workspace. Tagged users receive notificatio